00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:55.260
Who's presenting the conspiracy theory. Do they&nbsp;
have a motive to present a conspiracy theory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.260 --> 00:06:02.940
rather than what is suggested by the facts that&nbsp;
