00:06:02.940 --> 00:06:10.140
bias. Is the person giving you the theory or are&nbsp;
you looking for evidence that supports a certain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:15.420
conclusion already and ignoring evidence that&nbsp;
contradicts it? Confirmation bias. We've talked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:21.120
about that. Look for independent verification.&nbsp;
Check to see has the conspiracy theory been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:26.640
ident independently verified by others? Have other&nbsp;
people or organizations looked at the evidence and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:32.100
